  "policy_sha256": "84f656b16099dcb248866f714453e5bd3e275bdb5d4929c4fad838ee8b29ed2c",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00001",
      "text": "For those in need of a feel-good COVID-19 story, this one from Oz should fit the bill.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 86,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00002",
      "text": "The three people behind CovidBaseAU, one of the most successful Australian pandemic data website and Twitter account, have outed themselves. Guardian Australia explained the backstory:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 88,
      "body_end": 272,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2021/sep/24/absolutely-madness-melbourne-teenagers-reveal-they-are-behind-leading-covid-tracking-website"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00003",
      "text": "> It turns out one of the most authoritative Covid-19 tracking sites in Australia is run by three teenagers.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 274,
      "body_end": 382,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00004",
      "text": "> The team, who have been running CovidbaseAU, became part of their own statistics after getting their first doses of the Moderna vaccine in Melbourne.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 384,
      "body_end": 535,
      "source_links": [
        "https://covidbaseau.com/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00005",
      "text": "CovidBaseAU presents daily data about the pandemic in Australia, including local case numbers, tests, hospitalisations, deaths and vaccinations. It has national and state figures.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 537,
      "body_end": 716,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00006",
      "text": "Jack and Darcy are 15 years old and Wesley is 14. Their pinned tweet to celebrate getting their first shot of vaccine gave the game away:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 718,
      "body_end": 855,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00007",
      "text": "There were over 1,400 replies to the tweet in the first few hours. This exchange shed some light on the three go-getters:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 857,
      "body_end": 978,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00008",
      "text": "There were some high-powered congratulations, such as this tweet from public health professor Bill Bowtell:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 980,
      "body_end": 1087,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00009",
      "text": "The trio was interviewed by a fellow ‘numbers gremlin’, Casey Briggs, on ABC TV News (Australian Broadcasting Corporation). Briggs has been the ABC's regular TV data guru during the pandemic. His graphic presentations have won him a large loyal following on social media.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1089,
      "body_end": 1360,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/CaseyBriggs"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00010",
      "text": "The ABC joked that the trio was ‘unmasking’ themselves, which they literally did in the video:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "body_start": 1362,
      "body_end": 1456,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00011",
      "text": "They explained that their homeschooling lessons during lockdowns in Melbourne have helped them with this project.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "body_start": 1458,
      "body_end": 1571,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00012",
      "text": "‘Data geek’ Ben Krauth celebrated the complexity of their work:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "body_start": 1573,
      "body_end": 1636,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00013",
      "text": "There were plenty of doses of humour:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 13,
      "body_start": 1638,
      "body_end": 1675,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00014",
      "text": "They have a Patreon account if you'd like to become a patron.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 14,
      "body_start": 1677,
      "body_end": 1738,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.patreon.com/covidbaseau/posts#"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00015",
      "text": "Jack, Darcy and Wesley were overwhelmed by the response of their fellow Melburnians and well-wishers globally:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "body_start": 1740,
      "body_end": 1850,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00016",
      "text": "There was media coverage in several languages and from a far away as Ireland.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "body_start": 1852,
      "body_end": 1929,
      "source_links": [
        "https://neoskosmos.com/el/2021/09/24/news/treis-mathites-piso-apo-ton-koryfaio-istotopo-parakolouthisis-tou-covid-stin-afstralia/",
        "https://www.joe.ie/news/leading-australian-covid-19-tracking-website-revealed-run-three-teenagers-731903"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-746937-b00017",
      "text": "Anyway, we'll give them the last word:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 17,
      "body_start": 1931,
      "body_end": 1969,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
  ],
